# trigger, and on turn 3 the solved upkeep ability does not either. Turn 3: Bot1 empties the hand and "To solve"
# triggers, but Bot2 answers with Ancestral Recall on Bot1, so as it resolves Bot1 has cards in hand and the Case stays
# unsolved (no trigger on turn 5's upkeep). Turn 5: emptied again, the Case is solved; on turn 7 the upkeep ability
# draws two.

